se, especially extended limbs. All poses SAME pixels per body length, do not scale collapse poses up.\nHollow Saint: limbless leech, ivory crown/ring mouth, pale belly and red spines. Stable low hover; restrained segment wave and crown-mouth opening. Drain action: coil, extend mouth right, settle, recover. Death coiled limp serpent on ground; never humanoid.\nLAYOUT PRIORITY: wide LANDSCAPE 1536x1024 canvas. Exactly 4 columns x4rows. ALL 16 poses have at least 35px empty transparent space on ALL sides of each cell. Same scale throughout. No glow background.",
